  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\int_{-1 / 2}^{1 / 2} \\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{x+1}{x-1}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{x-1}{x+1}\\right)^{2}-2} d x=\\int_{-1 / 2}^{y / 2}\\left|\\frac{x+1}{x-1}-\\frac{x-1}{x+1}\\right| d x$\r\n$=\\int_{-1 / 2}^{0} \\frac{-4 x}{-(x-1)(x+1)} d x+\\int_{0}^{1 / 2} \\frac{4 x}{-(x-1)(x+1)} d x \\int_{-\\frac{1}{2}}^{0} \\frac{4 x}{x^{2}-1}-\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{4 x}{x^{2}-1} d x=4 \\ln 4 / 3$",
